  "job_B8.1.7.2_20251003_114824": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00f0\u00e6r feollon ofslagenne. & HIM \u00e6tflugon twegen ciningas, Zebee & Salmana, ac he sohte hi georne, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he hi gel\u00e6hte; & W\u00e6s \u00fea wuniende on fri\u00f0e feowertig wintra be Gedeones wissunge. Be \u00feisum we singa\u00f0 eac on \u00feam fores\u00e6dan sealme ongean Godes wi\u00f0erwinnan, \u00fee willa\u00f0 \u00e6fre HW\u00e6T \u00fea \u00e6fter fyrste \u00fe\u00e6t Israhela folc begunnon to geeacnienne heora ealdan synna mid edniwum & hine micclum gremedon, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he mid yrre hi on hand bet\u00e6hte \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enan leodscipum, se Hi wurdon \u00f0a gehergode & gehynde forswi\u00f0e eahtatyne gear under heora handa, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hig earmlice \u00d0A ofhearmode Gode heora yrm\u00f0a sona, & him foresceawode sumne heafodman, Iepthae gehaten, & He ferde \u00f0a mid fultume & heora fynd ofsloh, & hi God bet\u00e6hte to his anwealde, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea & HI wunodon on sibbe an & \u00f0ritig geara. \u00c6FTER \u00feisum fyrste hig fengon eft to gremienne \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan God on heora ealdan wisan mid An man w\u00e6s eardigende on Israhela \u00feeode, Manue gehaten, of \u00f0\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e Dan: his wif w\u00e6s Him com \u00fea gangende to Godes engel, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t hi sceoldon habban sunu him gem\u00e6ne; Se bi\u00f0 Heo acende \u00fea sunu, swa swa hyre s\u00e6de se engel, & het hine Samson, & he swi\u00f0e weoxs, & God & HE wear\u00f0 \u00fea miht",
